  "editorial": {
    "short_description": "Papers, Please in an SCP-inspired setting. You're an agent of a secret anomaly control bureau. Examine dangerous artifacts, conduct experiments and decide their fate. Keep the world from descending into chaos.",
    "integrated_description": "In Anomaly Control Simulator, you become an employee of a secret bureau for anomaly control. Every day, dozens of them pass through your department disguised as ordinary objects while breaking the laws of physics, logic, and reality itself. It's dangerous to go alone! Take this Examine artifacts with specialized equipment. Uncover dangerous properties, run tests, and decide the fate of each anomaly. And don't worry if you fail. You'll be very easy to replace. The ends justify the means The job must get done, even at the cost of a life. If not yours, then someone else's. Run experiments with people to uncover the dangerous properties of anomalies and make the right call. Keep an eye on the world's chaos level Think hard about what to do with each anomaly. The fate of the world depends on whose hands it falls into! A man's home is his castle Upgrade your workspace to improve efficiency. Sometimes they break loose A containment breach is no reason to stop working. Contain them at any cost. Not every threat looks like a monster Dozens of artifacts hide monstrous danger inside and only you stand between them and the world. Don't let us down!",
    "features": [
      "Single-player",
      "Steam Achievements",
      "Custom Volume Controls",
      "Playable without Timed Input",
      "Stereo Sound",
      "Steam Cloud",
      "Family Sharing"
    ]
